drumee-installer (1.2.7) stable; urgency=medium

  * Rename package from drumee-bootstrap to drumee-installer. The old name is
    needed for a different package under the container distribution design (the
    per-role entrypoints and healthchecks, docs/distribution.md §9.2), and this
    package is the interactive bare-metal installer, so the new name is also the
    accurate one. Replaces/Breaks retire the old name on existing hosts.
  * Second rename for this package: it was drumee-infra until 1.2.6, renamed for
    the same reason — a name wanted by something else.

 -- Somanos Sar <somanos.sar@drumee.com>  Thu, 30 Jul 2026 12:53:13 +0200

